/*  The rarer primaries — the cases of ParseCorePrimary that a handful of programs use each:
    matrices, chance, maps, sets, catalogues and atlases, channels and tasks, lambdas, running
    programs, reading, the file system and the environment.

    Reached from `core-primary` once its common cases have not matched, with the token already
    known; each case consumes its own opening word.
*/

Pull a book on collections.
    /// Comma-separated expressions up to `)`, after the `(` has been consumed.
    Bind void or failure to expressions-to-close unto parser, given (the node holder):
        Cast one's skip-noise.
        If cast one's peek-kind is not "RParen":
            Define first-item as cast one's expression or pass the failure off.
            Cast holder's add on (first-item).
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            While cast one's peek-kind is "Comma", repeat:
                Cast one's advance.
                Cast one's skip-noise.
                Define next-item as cast one's expression or pass the failure off.
                Cast holder's add on (next-item).
                Cast one's skip-noise.
            Done.
        Done.
        Cast one's consume on ("RParen") or pass the failure off.
    Done.

    /// `("k" : v, …)` after `with`, as a list of pairs.
    Bind void or failure to map-pairs unto parser, given (the node holder):
        Cast one's consume on ("LParen") or pass the failure off.
        Cast one's skip-noise.
        If cast one's peek-kind is not "RParen":
            Define going as true.
            While going, repeat:
                Define key as cast one's expression or pass the failure off.
                Cast one's skip-noise.
                Cast one's consume on ("Colon") or pass the failure off.
                Cast one's skip-noise.
                Define value as cast one's expression or pass the failure off.
                Define pair as cast listed.
                Cast pair's add on (key).
                Cast pair's add on (value).
                Cast holder's add on (pair).
                Cast one's skip-noise.
                If cast one's peek-kind is "Comma":
                    Cast one's advance.
                    Cast one's skip-noise.
                Done.
                Otherwise:
                    The going becomes false.
                Done.
            Done.
        Done.
        Cast one's consume on ("RParen") or pass the failure off.
    Done.

    /// The one open union — `(UnionType _)`, a union whose cases are discovered, not declared.
    Bind node to open-union:
        Return cast made on ("UnionType", a series with (cast nothing)).
    Done.

    Bind node or failure to rare-primary unto parser, given (the text kind, the token tok):
        If kind is "Matrix":
            Cast one's advance.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            Cast one's consume on ("With") or pass the failure off.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            If cast one's peek-kind is "LParen":
                Cast one's advance.
                Cast one's skip-noise.
                Define rows as cast listed.
                If cast one's peek-kind is not "RParen":
                    Define going as true.
                    While going, repeat:
                        Cast one's consume on ("LParen") or pass the failure off.
                        Define row as cast listed.
                        Cast one's expressions-to-close on (row) or pass the failure off.
                        Cast rows's add on (row).
                        Cast one's skip-noise.
                        If cast one's peek-kind is "Comma":
                            Cast one's advance.
                            Cast one's skip-noise.
                        Done.
                        Otherwise:
                            The going becomes false.
                        Done.
                    Done.
                Done.
                Cast one's consume on ("RParen") or pass the failure off.
                Return cast placed on ("MatrixLiteral", a series with (rows), tok).
            Done.
            Define row-count as cast one's expression or pass the failure off.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            Cast one's consume on ("By") or pass the failure off.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            Define column-count as cast one's expression or pass the failure off.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            Define fill as cast nothing.
            If cast one's is-word on ("filled"):
                Cast one's advance.
                Cast one's skip-noise.
                Cast one's consume on ("With") or pass the failure off.
                Cast one's skip-noise.
                The fill becomes cast one's expression or pass the failure off.
            Done.
            Return cast placed on ("MatrixSized", a series with (row-count, column-count, fill), tok).
        Done.

        If kind is "Random":
            Cast one's advance.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            If cast one's peek-kind is "NumberKw":
                Cast one's advance.
                Cast one's skip-noise.
                Cast one's consume on ("From") or pass the failure off.
                Cast one's skip-noise.
                Define low as cast one's addition or pass the failure off.
                Cast one's skip-noise.
                Cast one's consume on ("To") or pass the failure off.
                Cast one's skip-noise.
                Define high as cast one's addition or pass the failure off.
                Return cast placed on ("RandomNumber", a series with (low, high), tok).
            Done.
            If cast one's peek-kind is "Item":
                Cast one's advance.
                Cast one's skip-noise.
                Cast one's consume on ("From") or pass the failure off.
                Cast one's skip-noise.
                Define pool as cast one's core-primary or pass the failure off.
                Return cast placed on ("RandomItem", a series with (pool), tok).
            Done.
            If cast one's is-word on ("guess"):
                Cast one's advance.
                Return cast placed on ("RandomGuess", a series of node, tok).
            Done.
            Return a failure (cast one's expecting on (cast one's peek, "number, item, or guess — expected after 'random'")).
        Done.

        If kind is "Randomly":
            Cast one's advance.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            Cast one's consume-word on ("shuffled") or pass the failure off.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            Define pool as cast one's core-primary or pass the failure off.
            Return cast placed on ("RandomlyShuffled", a series with (pool), tok).
        Done.

        If kind is "CatalogueKw":
            Cast one's advance.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            Define annotation as cast open-union.
            If cast one's peek-kind is "Of":
                Cast one's advance.
                Cast one's skip-noise.
                The annotation becomes cast one's type-annotation or pass the failure off.
                Cast one's skip-noise.
            Done.
            Define elements as cast listed.
            If cast one's peek-kind is "With":
                Cast one's advance.
                Cast one's skip-noise.
                Cast one's consume on ("LParen") or pass the failure off.
                Cast one's expressions-to-close on (elements) or pass the failure off.
            Done.
            Return cast placed on ("SeriesLiteral", a series with (elements, annotation), tok).
        Done.

        If kind is "AtlasKw" or kind is "Map":
            Cast one's advance.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            Define key-type as cast nothing.
            Define value-type as cast nothing.
            If kind is "AtlasKw":
                The key-type becomes cast plain-type on ("TextType").
                The value-type becomes cast open-union.
            Done.
            If cast one's peek-kind is "From":
                Cast one's advance.
                Cast one's skip-noise.
                The key-type becomes cast one's type-annotation or pass the failure off.
                Cast one's skip-noise.
                Cast one's consume on ("To") or pass the failure off.
                Cast one's skip-noise.
                The value-type becomes cast one's type-annotation or pass the failure off.
                Cast one's skip-noise.
            Done.
            Define pairs as cast listed.
            // A map with no types written needs its entries; an atlas and a typed map do not.
            Define needs-entries as kind is "Map" and value-type's word is "_".
            If needs-entries or cast one's peek-kind is "With":
                Cast one's consume on ("With") or pass the failure off.
                Cast one's skip-noise.
                Cast one's map-pairs on (pairs) or pass the failure off.
            Done.
            Return cast placed on ("MapLiteral", a series with (key-type, value-type, pairs), tok).
        Done.

        If kind is "SetKw":
            Cast one's advance.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            Cast one's consume on ("Of") or pass the failure off.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            Define element-type as cast one's type-annotation or pass the failure off.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            Define members as cast listed.
            If cast one's peek-kind is "With":
                Cast one's advance.
                Cast one's skip-noise.
                Cast one's consume on ("LParen") or pass the failure off.
                Cast one's skip-noise.
                While cast one's peek-kind is not "RParen", repeat:
                    Define member as cast one's expression or pass the failure off.
                    Cast members's add on (member).
                    Cast one's skip-noise.
                    If cast one's peek-kind is "Comma":
                        Cast one's advance.
                        Cast one's skip-noise.
                    Done.
                Done.
                Cast one's consume on ("RParen") or pass the failure off.
            Done.
            Return cast placed on ("SetLiteral", a series with (element-type, members), tok).
        Done.

        If kind is "Channel":
            Cast one's advance.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            Cast one's consume on ("Of") or pass the failure off.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            Define element-type as cast one's type-annotation or pass the failure off.
            Return cast placed on ("ChannelCreation", a series with (element-type), tok).
        Done.

        If kind is "Delivery":
            Cast one's advance.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            Cast one's consume on ("From") or pass the failure off.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            Define source as cast one's expression or pass the failure off.
            Return cast placed on ("DeliveryExpression", a series with (source), tok).
        Done.

        If kind is "Awaited":
            Cast one's advance.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            If cast one's peek-kind is "Identifier" and cast one's is-word on ("result"), cast one's advance.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            Cast one's consume on ("Of") or pass the failure off.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            Define awaited-task as cast one's expr-or or pass the failure off.
            Return cast placed on ("AwaitedResultExpression", a series with (awaited-task), tok).
        Done.

        If kind is "Entry":
            Cast one's advance.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            Cast one's consume on ("For") or pass the failure off.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            Define key as cast one's expression or pass the failure off.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            Cast one's consume on ("In") or pass the failure off.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            Define mapping as cast one's core-primary or pass the failure off.
            Return cast placed on ("MapLookup", a series with (mapping, key), tok).
        Done.

        If kind is "FunctionKw":
            Cast one's advance.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            Define parameters as cast listed.
            If cast one's peek-kind is "Given":
                Cast one's advance.
                Cast one's skip-noise.
                Cast one's consume on ("LParen") or pass the failure off.
                Cast one's skip-noise.
                If cast one's peek-kind is not "RParen":
                    Define first-parameter as cast one's parameter or pass the failure off.
                    Cast parameters's add on (first-parameter).
                    Cast one's skip-noise.
                    While cast one's peek-kind is "Comma", repeat:
                        Cast one's advance.
                        Cast one's skip-noise.
                        Define next-parameter as cast one's parameter or pass the failure off.
                        Cast parameters's add on (next-parameter).
                        Cast one's skip-noise.
                    Done.
                Done.
                Cast one's consume on ("RParen") or pass the failure off.
                Cast one's skip-noise.
            Done.
            Cast one's consume on ("Colon") or pass the failure off.
            Define saved-free-function as one's in-free-function.
            One's in-free-function becomes true.
            Increment one's function-depth by 1.
            Increment one's nest-depth by 1.
            Define body as cast listed.
            Define scanning as true.
            While scanning, repeat:
                Cast one's skip-noise.
                If cast one's peek-kind is "Done" or cast one's peek-kind is "Eof", stop.
                Define inner as cast one's statement or pass the failure off.
                Cast body's add on (inner).
            Done.
            Cast one's consume on ("Done") or pass the failure off.
            Decrement one's nest-depth by 1.
            Decrement one's function-depth by 1.
            One's in-free-function becomes saved-free-function.
            Return cast placed on ("LambdaLiteral", a series with (parameters, body), tok).
        Done.

        If kind is "Run":
            Cast one's advance.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            Define program as cast one's expr-or or pass the failure off.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            Define args as cast listed.
            Define args-series as cast nothing.
            Define with-terminal as false.
            Define fed-input as cast nothing.
            Define said-arguments as false.
            While cast one's peek-kind is "With", repeat:
                Cast one's advance.
                Cast one's skip-noise.
                If cast one's is-word on ("terminal"):
                    If with-terminal:
                        Return a failure (cast one's refused on (cast one's peek, "this run already says 'with the terminal'")).
                    Done.
                    Cast one's advance.
                    The with-terminal becomes true.
                Done.
                Otherwise if cast one's is-word on ("input"):
                    If fed-input's word is not "_":
                        Return a failure (cast one's refused on (cast one's peek, "this run already says 'with input'")).
                    Done.
                    Cast one's advance.
                    Cast one's skip-noise.
                    The fed-input becomes cast one's expr-or or pass the failure off.
                Done.
                Otherwise:
                    If cast one's peek-kind is not "Arguments":
                        Return a failure (cast one's refused on (cast one's peek,
                            "expected 'arguments', 'input' or 'the terminal' after 'with' in a run expression")).
                    Done.
                    If said-arguments:
                        Return a failure (cast one's refused on (cast one's peek, "this run already says 'with arguments'")).
                    Done.
                    Cast one's advance.
                    The said-arguments becomes true.
                    Cast one's skip-noise.
                    If cast one's peek-kind is "LParen":
                        Cast one's advance.
                        Cast one's expressions-to-close on (args) or pass the failure off.
                    Done.
                    Otherwise:
                        The args-series becomes cast one's expr-or or pass the failure off.
                    Done.
                Done.
            Done.
            Return cast made on ("RunExpression", a series with (program, args, args-series,
                cast row-of on (tok), cast column-of on (tok), cast flag on (with-terminal), fed-input)).
        Done.

        If kind is "Read":
            Cast one's advance.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            Define form as "".
            If cast one's is-word on ("line"):
                Cast one's advance.
                The form becomes "Line".
            Done.
            Otherwise if cast one's is-word on ("all"):
                Cast one's advance.
                Cast one's skip-noise.
                The form becomes "All".
                If cast one's is-word on ("lines"):
                    Cast one's advance.
                    The form becomes "AllLines".
                Done.
            Done.
            Otherwise:
                Return a failure (cast one's refused on (cast one's peek, "expected 'line', 'all', or 'all lines' after 'read'")).
            Done.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            Cast one's consume on ("From") or pass the failure off.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            If cast one's peek-kind is "File":
                If form is "Line":
                    Return a failure (cast one's refused on (cast one's peek, "a line has to be read from an open stream, not from a path — a path has nowhere to "
                        joined to "remember how far you have read, so every read would hand back the first line. Open "
                        joined to "it first: 'With the file \"x\" open for reading as src:', then 'read a line from src'. "
                        joined to "('read all from the file \"x\"' needs no stream, because it keeps no position.)")).
                Done.
                Cast one's advance.
                Cast one's skip-noise.
                Define path-expr as cast one's expr-or or pass the failure off.
                Define file-form as "AllLines" when form is "AllLines", otherwise "All".
                Return cast placed on ("FileReadExpression", a series with (cast atom on (file-form), path-expr), tok).
            Done.
            Define source as cast one's expr-or or pass the failure off.
            Return cast placed on ("ReadExpression", a series with (cast atom on (form), source), tok).
        Done.

        If kind is "ContentsKw":
            Cast one's advance.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            Cast one's consume on ("Of") or pass the failure off.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            Cast one's consume on ("DirectoryKw") or pass the failure off.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            Define path-expr as cast one's joined-to or pass the failure off.
            Return cast placed on ("DirectoryContentsExpression", a series with (path-expr), tok).
        Done.

        If kind is "PathKw":
            Cast one's advance.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            Define path-expr as cast one's joined-to or pass the failure off.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            If cast one's peek-kind is "Identifier" and cast one's is-word on ("exists"):
                Cast one's advance.
                Return cast placed on ("PathCheckExpression", a series with (path-expr, cast atom on ("Exists")), tok).
            Done.
            Cast one's consume on ("Is") or pass the failure off.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            If cast one's peek-kind is "DirectoryKw":
                Cast one's advance.
                Return cast placed on ("PathCheckExpression", a series with (path-expr, cast atom on ("IsDirectory")), tok).
            Done.
            If cast one's peek-kind is "File":
                Cast one's advance.
                Return cast placed on ("PathCheckExpression", a series with (path-expr, cast atom on ("IsFile")), tok).
            Done.
            Return a failure (cast one's refused on (cast one's peek, "expected 'directory' or 'file' after 'the path ... is a'")).
        Done.

        If kind is "EnvironmentKw":
            Cast one's advance.
            If cast one's peek-kind is not "Identifier" or cast one's is-word on ("variable") is false:
                Return a failure (cast one's refused on (cast one's peek, "expected 'variable' after 'environment'")).
            Done.
            Cast one's advance.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            Define variable-name as cast one's expr-or or pass the failure off.
            Return cast placed on ("EnvironmentVariableExpression", a series with (variable-name), tok).
        Done.

        If kind is "Arguments":
            Cast one's advance.
            Return cast placed on ("ProgramArgumentsExpression", a series of node, tok).
        Done.

        If kind is "CurrentKw":
            Cast one's advance.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            Cast one's consume on ("DirectoryKw") or pass the failure off.
            Return cast placed on ("CurrentDirectoryExpression", a series of node, tok).
        Done.

        If kind is "InterruptKw":
            Cast one's advance.
            Cast one's consume on ("Is") or pass the failure off.
            If cast one's peek-kind is not "Identifier" or cast one's is-word on ("requested") is false:
                Return a failure (cast one's refused on (cast one's peek, "expected 'requested' after 'an interrupt is'")).
            Done.
            Cast one's advance.
            Return cast placed on ("InterruptRequestedExpression", a series of node, tok).
        Done.

        Return a failure (cast one's expecting on (tok, "expression")).
    Done.
Done.
